  "builder_delta": "Only role6 source digest, first documentation line, and the independently proved DMS9 header-helper digest change. All other complete builder bytes are equal to the previous FS8 builder.",
  "continuation_proof": {
    "source_save": "The original USER blob contains256 bytes of USER header and exactly256+pathLength peer bytes. The FS request starts source+296; original path starts source+552. Checked length>=512 before subtraction.",
    "header": "The existing actual DMS completion preserves its issued FS request at workspace768. Every32 original header words must equal the saved request before accepting the response. Caller/action is passed unchanged through DMS lease and not replaced with the outer USER lease.",
    "path": "The actual DMS request contains a320-byte envelope/header and exactlypathLength tail. Its actual CHILD source tail at128+320 is compared bytewise to the saved path.",
    "sequence": "FS scope and next FS call are checked before issue. Exhaustion is rejected. Existing j_accept_dms commits the actual FS and syscall watermarks only after completion output reservation succeeds.",
    "length_arithmetic": "j_child_shape requires actual source>=320 and workspace>=8192 within one total u64 source extent, leaving more than256 bytes outside output. j_gateway_frame proves FS payload<=borrowed_capacity-256 and borrowed_capacity<=actual_DMS_output-256. Therefore256+FS_payload and256+(256+FS_payload) cannot overflow under these already checked total extents.",
    "grow": "j_user reserves USER plus DMS source records before issuing. Post-child j_reserve may compact mutable workspace, but all saved pointer comparisons happen before that call; afterwards only immutable CHILD input and re-resolved original helper state are read. Output GROW does not change stage62, issue another child or accept watermarks.",
    "known_error": "A valid FS errno remains inside the original FS header. DMS gateway succeeds as a carrier; the outer returns exactlythe logical actual FS prefix. No implicit retry or close is introduced.",
    "permanent_refusal": "Malformed issued header, sequence, scope, extent or actual completion follows existing j_reject. Subsequent invocation remains poisoned.",
    "provenance_limit": "Private fixed issuer and actual CHILD capsule remain required. Header bytes, numbers, request copy and Graph identifiers do not authenticate arbitrary external state."
